033|         uint256 ethReceived,\n00034|         uint256 ethSent\n00035|     );\n00036| \n00037|     /// @notice Emitted when a user withdraws LQTY or claims V1 staking rewards\n00038|     /// @param user The account withdrawing LQTY or claiming V1 staking rewards\n00039|     /// @param recipient The account receiving the LQTY withdrawn, and if claimed, the LUSD/ETH rewards earned from staking in V1\n00040|     /// @return lqtyReceived Amount of LQTY tokens actually withdrawn (may be lower than the `_lqtyAmount` passed to `withdrawLQTY`)\n00041|     /// @return lqtySent Amount of LQTY tokens sent to `recipient` (may include LQTY sent to the user's proxy from sources other than V1 staking)\n00042|     /// @return lusdReceived Amount of LUSD tokens received as a side-effect of staking new LQTY\n00043|     /// @return lusdSent Amount of LUSD tokens sent to `recipient` (may include previously received LUSD)\n00044|     /// @return ethReceived Amount of ETH received as a side-effect of staking new LQTY\n00045|     /// @return ethSent Amount of ETH sent to `recipient` (may include previously received ETH)\n00046|     event WithdrawLQTY(\n00047|         address indexed user,\n00048|         address recipient,\n00049|         uint256 lqtyReceived,\n00050|         uint256 lqtySent,\n\n(File has more lines. Use 'offset' parameter to read beyond line 50)\n</file>","title":"src/interfaces/IGovernance.sol","metadata":{"preview":"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity ^0.8.24;\n\nimport {IERC20} from \"openzeppelin/contracts/interfaces/IERC20.sol\";\n\nimport {ILQTYStaking} from \"./ILQTYStaking.sol\";\n\nimport {PermitParams} from \"../utils/Types.sol\";\n\nuint256 constant UNREGISTERED_INITIATIVE = type(uint256).max;\n\ninterface IGovernance {\n    enum HookStatus {\n        Failed,\n        Succeeded,\n        NotCalled\n    }\n\n    /// @notice Emitted when a user deposits LQTY\n    /// @param user The account depositing LQTY"},"time":{"start":1763348811413,"end":1